{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgAsHYqpZVFA3pr71G2Hh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The new UI wasn't wrapped in `PostHogWidget`, so replay had nothing to record. I've added the wrapper; `flutter analyze` passes, but I haven't run it on a device or checked PostHog.\n\n**Why:** on mobile, `posthog_flutter` builds replays from screenshots of the screen, and `PostHogWidget` is what takes them. The old UI in `lib/legacy_app.dart` has its `MaterialApp` inside `PostHogWidget`. The new UI in `lib/new_app.dart` returned a bare `MaterialApp.router`. Recording is still switched on and the router still reports screens, so events, screen views and taps keep arriving, but with no screenshots there's no recording. The SDK gives no error or warning when this happens. That explains everything in the ticket: same SDK and build for both groups, settings fine, events present, replays only from the old UI.\n\n**Fix:** in `lib/new_app.dart`, `MaterialApp.router` is now inside `PostHogWidget`, with a comment saying why it's needed so it doesn't get removed again. Nothing else changed: the SDK settings, screen tracking and text masking are as they were. These are the only two app roots in `lib/`, and both are now covered.\n\n`ANSWER.md` has the cause, the fix and steps to check it: run with `--dart-define=NEW_UI=true`, go through a few screens, put the app in the background, and the session should show up in PostHog's Session replay. It only takes effect once a new store release goes out, and sessions from builds already shipped will still have no replays.\n\n`flutter pub get` also created untracked local files (`pubspec.lock`, `.dart_tool/`). Nothing is committed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":210,"cache_read_input_tokens":26958,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":210},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2d82956d-9731-4641-95dc-9ad8c62b074d","uuid":"43f3556f-2c57-434f-8e58-0afd3504cdec","timestamp":"2026-10-19T03:14:45.513Z","request_id":"req_011CgAsHYbSCD6QZWTx5C3Xx"}
